WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.102
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.102 --> 00:00:04.503
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.503 --> 00:00:05.872
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.872 --> 00:00:09.609
In a new interview, the Russian
ambassador to the U.S.

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:12.045
said that he hasn't talked
to President Vladimir Putin

00:00:12.045 --> 00:00:13.646
since 2017.

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:16.216
"Yes, you have,"
said a houseplant.

00:00:16.216 --> 00:00:18.418
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:20.686
After a federal judge
ruled yesterday

00:00:20.686 --> 00:00:22.588
that the CDC mask mandate

00:00:22.588 --> 00:00:24.524
on public transportation
was unlawful,

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:28.294
New York's MTA announced that it
will still enforce the mandate.

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:31.664
However, you are allowed
to briefly pull the mask down

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:34.767
to smoke weed on the subway car
during the morning rush hour.

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:36.669
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:39.806
In a new special,
Fox News host Tucker Carlson

00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:42.908
discussed a red-light therapy
called testicle tanning

00:00:42.908 --> 00:00:46.379
that advocates claim
can raise testosterone levels.

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:49.516
Oh, I think there's a place
on the corner that does that.

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:51.750
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:54.020
So you should stop by.

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:55.454
Pretty cool.

00:00:55.454 --> 00:00:58.024
New York City, you know.

00:00:58.024 --> 00:01:00.360
Tesla CEO Elon Musk said
in a new interview

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:01.795
that he does not own a home

00:01:01.795 --> 00:01:03.362
and has just been staying
with friends.

00:01:03.362 --> 00:01:04.997
Listen, we know you're lying.

00:01:04.997 --> 00:01:07.867
You're a billionaire.

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:11.170
You don't have any friends.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:14.240
That's right, Elon Musk says
that he does not own a home

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:15.741
and has just been staying
with friends.

00:01:15.741 --> 00:01:19.478
Man, it's got to be pretty
galling to come home from work

00:01:19.478 --> 00:01:22.014
and the world's richest man
is watching "Jeopardy!"

00:01:22.014 --> 00:01:24.817
and eating your Cheerios.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.817 --> 00:01:27.887
That's like Snoop coming over
to bum some weed.

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:29.388
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.388 --> 00:01:32.425
The "New York Daily News"
published an op-ed yesterday

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:35.194
by disgraced former governor
Andrew Cuomo,

00:01:35.194 --> 00:01:38.131
though it was weird
he put that in his byline.

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:40.967
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.967 --> 00:01:44.103
According to a new survey,
a quarter of Americans

00:01:44.103 --> 00:01:46.272
said that they would want
a professional biographer

00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:47.773
to write the story
of their life,

00:01:47.773 --> 00:01:50.877
while some literally
can't get them to stop.

00:01:50.877 --> 00:01:52.912
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.912 --> 00:01:54.914
West Virginia senator
Joe Manchin

00:01:54.914 --> 00:01:56.048
reportedly told a crowd

00:01:56.048 --> 00:01:58.918
at a $5,000-a-plate fundraiser
last month

00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:01.988
that he plans to run
for re-election in 2024.

00:02:01.988 --> 00:02:03.589
Well, I should hope so.

00:02:03.589 --> 00:02:05.591
Although it would be hilarious

00:02:05.591 --> 00:02:08.628
to charge people $5,000
for a chicken cutlet

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:10.563
and then announce
your retirement.

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:11.397
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:13.032
"Old Joe is goin' fishin'.

00:02:13.032 --> 00:02:14.867
Enjoy the chicken, suckers."

00:02:14.867 --> 00:02:16.169
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.169 --> 00:02:18.337
And finally,
according to a new survey,

00:02:18.337 --> 00:02:21.707
42% of Americans said
that if they had the chance

00:02:21.707 --> 00:02:23.276
to meet their
favorite celebrity,

00:02:23.276 --> 00:02:24.711
they would ask for a selfie,

00:02:24.711 --> 00:02:27.847
or in my experience,
directions to Times Square.

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:30.382
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.382 --> 00:02:33.052
"Oh, sure, anything,
anything for a fan.

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:35.321
Hey, while I'm here,
you want a selfie?

00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:36.889
You don't.
Okay.

00:02:36.889 --> 00:02:38.524
How about I take a picture
of you?

00:02:38.524 --> 00:02:40.326
Just -- No?
Okay.

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:42.061
Right down there."

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:43.596
You guys,
that was the monologue.

